<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans fell - May 14 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans fell - May 14 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED MAY 7</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............810,600 down...3,000</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......722,700 down...6,300</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......557,600 down...2,700</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED MAY 14</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....851,631 down...6,685</p>
<p> Financial companies.......658,823 down...1,798</p>
<p> New York business loans....46,081 down.....215</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......45,817 down.....212</p>
</text>
